        51.023799896240234,
        42.276031494140625,
        408.0626525878906,
        51.276031494140625
      ],
      "text": "As described below, systematic reviews of published studies show that a pooled average of",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.89780044555664,
        54.273040771484375,
        408.1077575683594,
        63.273040771484375
      ],
      "text": "3.5–5.5% (the equivalent of a prevalence of 3500–5500 per 100 000 population) of household",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.94279861450195,
        66.27005004882812,
        410.1145935058594,
        75.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "members or other close contact with a person who has infectious TB are themselves found",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.987796783447266,
        78.26705932617188,
        410.16839599609375,
        87.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "to have previously undiagnosed, active TB, although there is considerable heterogeneity",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.04179763793945,
        90.26406860351562,
        408.17974853515625,
        99.27597045898438
      ],
      "text": "in these results (7,8). These ﬁndings suggest that contact investigation may result in earlier",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.014888763427734,
        102.27297973632812,
        408.2065734863281,
        111.27297973632812
      ],
      "text": "identiﬁcation of cases, possibly decreasing disease severity and reducing transmission of",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.04188919067383,
        114.13373565673828,
        408.43170166015625,
        123.26998901367188
      ],
      "text": "Mycobacterium tuberculosis . Despite this potential beneﬁt, routine contact investigation is",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Italic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.25790023803711,
        126.26699829101562,
        332.57086181640625,
        135.26699829101562
      ],
      "text": "performed in only a few countries with high to medium incidences of TB.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.266902923583984,
        144.26699829101562,
        408.48577880859375,
        153.26699829101562
      ],
      "text": "At least six current concerns suggest that the evidence for broadened contact investigation",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.3119010925293,
        156.26400756835938,
        260.5796203613281,
        165.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "guidelines and recommendations should be reviewed:",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.0326042175293,
        174.27603149414062,
        408.17938232421875,
        183.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "• Diagnostic delay is increasingly recognized as an impediment to effective TB control (9,10).",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.0056037902832,
        192.27603149414062,
        358.3465576171875,
        201.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "• Some countries are seeking to improve suboptimal programme performance.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.01460647583008,
        210.27603149414062,
        410.1954650878906,
        219.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "• Some countries that are performing well are ready to enter a new phase of TB control:",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        59.573604583740234,
        222.27304077148438,
        369.5335693359375,
        231.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "to identify all TB cases. Contact investigation would be an appropriate next step.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.086605072021484,
        240.27304077148438,
        408.12164306640625,
        249.27606201171875
      ],
      "text": "• Intensiﬁed case ﬁnding has been shown to minimize the impact of TB in PLHIV, and contact",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        59.58779525756836,
        252.2730712890625,
        317.5547790527344,
        261.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "investigation is a targeted approach to intensiﬁed case ﬁnding (4).",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.091793060302734,
        268.15374755859375,
        408.22052001953125,
        279.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "< • Because of the high risk of children   5 years of age for TB, contact investigation may result",
      "font": "LucidaGrande",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        59.68679428100586,
        282.27008056640625,
        408.32855224609375,
        291.27008056640625
      ],
      "text": "in early detection of disease and identify candidates for treatment of LTBI per WHO",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        59.66879653930664,
        294.26708984375,
        144.68280029296875,
        303.26708984375
      ],
      "text": "recommendations (1).",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.172794342041016,
        312.26708984375,
        408.0661926269531,
        321.2760925292969
      ],
      "text": "• Systematic investigation of contacts of known or suspected cases of multi-drug-resistant",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        59.53231430053711,
        324.27294921875,
        408.08392333984375,
        333.27294921875
      ],
      "text": "TB (MDR-TB) may be effective for reducing the ongoing transmission of drug-resistant",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        59.55031204223633,
        336.1336975097656,
        338.4331970214844,
        345.26995849609375
      ],
      "text": "M. tuberculosis strains of   in a community, although this as yet unproven.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Italic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.0543098449707,
        366.09625244140625,
        105.10831451416016,
        375.09625244140625
      ],
      "text": "1.5 METHODS",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.0543098449707,
        384.2669677734375,
        408.2460021972656,
        393.2669677734375
      ],
      "text": "These recommendations were prepared following the WHO procedures for guideline",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.0813102722168,
        396.26397705078125,
        408.2550354003906,
        405.26397705078125
      ],
      "text": "development (11). A steering committee consisting of Stop TB Department staff met twice to",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.09031295776367,
        408.260986328125,
        408.5556945800781,
        417.27899169921875
      ],
      "text": "determine the scope of the document, to identify relevant questions and to review the plan.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.01279830932617,
        420.2730712890625,
        408.2496643066406,
        429.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "A panel of experts in relevant areas was selected as the Guideline Development Group",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.075801849365234,
        432.27008056640625,
        408.2585144042969,
        441.27008056640625
      ],
      "text": "(GDG)The near-ﬁnal draft was submitted to 45 reviewers in late November 2011.These",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.09379959106445,
        444.2670593261719,
        408.2495422363281,
        453.2670593261719
      ],
      "text": "reviewers were selected based on their partner afﬁliation, expertise, perspectives and",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.08479690551758,
        456.2640686035156,
        408.2586975097656,
        465.2640686035156
      ],
      "text": "geographic regions. They were solicited to review and submit comments. Nineteen of them",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.09379959106445,
        468.2610778808594,
        340.7572937011719,
        477.2790832519531
      ],
      "text": "did so. Their comments were taken into account in ﬁnalizing the document",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.02939987182617,
        486.2752380371094,
        408.4730224609375,
        495.2752380371094
      ],
      "text": "All GDG members and the external reviewers, who provided comments on the document,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.86739730834961,
        498.2722473144531,
        408.06829833984375,
        507.2722473144531
      ],
      "text": "completed and signed the WHO form on conﬂict of interest. No conﬂicts were identiﬁed. Input",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.02939987182617,
        510.2692565917969,
        408.17633056640625,
        519.269287109375
      ],
      "text": "from the expert group was obtained by a face-to-face meeting in September 2011, conference",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.01140213012695,
        522.2662963867188,
        408.1943359375,
        531.2752685546875
      ],
      "text": "calls and e-mail. A draft for comments was presented to a meeting of stakeholders at the",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.02938461303711,
        534.2713623046875,
        408.6231689453125,
        543.2722778320312
      ],
      "text": "World Conference of the International Union Against Tuberculosis and Lung Disease in Lille,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.0174674987793,
        546.2683715820312,
        142.13348388671875,
        555.2683715820312
      ],
      "text": "France, in October 2011.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
